<title>KENYA: 12 drowned in Lake Victoria boat capsize.</title>
<headline>12 drowned in Lake Victoria boat capsize.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten Ugandans and two Kenyans died when a boat carrying 30 passengers capsized in the Kenyan waters of Lake Victoria on Friday night, local officials said on Sunday.</p>
<p>They said the survivors were rescued near Port Victoria in western Kenya.</p>
